# Animated Counters for Nuestra Trayectoria

The user wants the numbers in the "Nuestra Trayectoria" section of the Hero component to animate as counters from 0 to their target value when the page loads.

## Proposed Changes

### [Hero Component]
#### [MODIFY] [Hero.tsx](file:///Users/santiagovalencia/Documents/landing-siprac/landing-siprac/siprac-website/components/sections/Hero.tsx)
- Add a `"use client"` directive to enable hooks.
- Implement an `AnimatedCounter` component using `useState`, `useEffect`, and `useRef`.
- The counter will use `requestAnimationFrame` for a smooth, high-performance animation.
- Update the `stats` mapping to use the `AnimatedCounter` component for each stat.
- Ensure the animation is fast (around 1.5 - 2 seconds total duration).

## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests
- Run `npm run build` to ensure no issues with client components or hooks.

### Manual Verification
- Refresh the home page and verify the numbers in the "Nuestra Trayectoria" section animate from 0 to their final values (100+, 50+, 15+).
- Check that the animation is fluid and responsive.
